<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
    <title>SubFlow - 오류</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body class="sf-auth-body">
<main class="sf-auth-card">
    <h1 class="sf-auth-brand">SubFlow</h1>
    <p class="sf-auth-lead">요청을 처리하는 중 문제가 발생했습니다.</p>
    <p class="sf-auth-note">오류 코드: {{status}}</p>
    {{#requestId}}
    <p class="sf-auth-note">요청 ID: {{requestId}}</p>
    {{/requestId}}
    <p class="sf-auth-note"><a href="/">홈으로 돌아가기</a></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
